            "review_text": "Hiro\n136 contributions\n2\nThe Cafe Supporting Mindful Living\nSep 2019 • Friends\nThis cafe/shop is supporting mindful living in Saigon by hosting yoga class, using less plastics and so on. They not only have tasty fresh drinks and food but also have good ambience with wooden furnitures. Staff there are very friendly too. If you are in Saigon and would like to be refreshed, this place would be the one for you.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 2, 2019",
