            "review_text": "Louis V\n15 contributions\n0\nThe small house with 2 storey is the model of healthy lifestyle\nJun 2019 • Friends\nThe zero-waste shop at 1st Fl. helps to minimise the environmental impact of our consumer habits by ending excess packaging. The shop filled with nuts, seeds and dried fruit, cacao, coffee tea served from many hoppers to avoid plastic packaging; washing-up or laundry liquid and coconut oil that customers pump into their battered old squeezy bottles; plus an array of environmentally friendly products, such as bamboo toothbrush holders, silk bag, wood flower pot,... Yoga studio is at 2nd fl. with many lessons from basic to intermediate such as kite class, sun, and hatha. I love doing yoga here because the number of yogee is not too crowded as the other yoga centers. The yoga teacher is always fix the position for everyone avoiding bad affected of my bone.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 21, 2019",
